OL,3,GNEWSAPat Finucane a victim of          
OL,4,Astate-sponsored murder, family lawyer  
OL,5,Atells inquiry                          
OL,7,FPat Finucane was the victim of a UK    
OL,8,F"state-sponsored murder", a lawyer     
OL,9,Facting for the solicitor's family has  
OL,10,Ftold the public inquiry into the       
OL,11,Floyalist murder.                       
OL,13,FDanny Friedman KC told the inquiry it  
OL,14,Fmust answer "how far up the chain of   
OL,15,Fcommand" the killing went.             
OL,17,FThe 39-year-old solicitor was shot at  
OL,18,Fhis home in north Belfast by the Ulster
OL,19,FDefence Association (UDA) in front of  
OL,20,Fhis wife and children in February 1989.
